cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Etichette: label printing for production reels and pallets (db, 2000–2001)"
version: "1.0"
abstract: "Etichette prints the identification labels of the reels produced by a plastic-film plant. For each production order (ODL) the operator enters length, weight, colour, thickness, height, type, customer order and date, chooses the number of copies and prints the labels; the printed labels are logged. The repository contains the four variants used in the plant: the standard version, the versions for dot-matrix (needle) and laser printers, and the pallet label that reads the production-order data."
authors:
